 "summary": "The atlas-change null-set lemmas, the change-of-atlas map and the atlas equivalence are new material that builds on existing API (`SectionChartData.exists_section`, `coord_chart`, `ContinuousLinearMap.ofSeqClosedGraph`, Mathlib's Haar-image lemma), and the Morrey proofs now reuse the new add/smul lemmas. The only similar proofs (`aeTransition_of_differentiableOn`, `isClosed_setOf_compatible`) cover transitions within one atlas and cannot be applied to two atlases.",
